<title>USA: Continental starts Houston-Vancouver route.</title>
<headline>Continental starts Houston-Vancouver route.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Airlines Inc said it will begin offering daily, non-stop service between Vancouver, British Columbia, and Houston's Bush Intercontinental Airport beginning today, Thursday.</p>
<p>For the upcoming July 4th holiday weekend, Continental said the fare will be $238.90 round-trip, excluding taxes. Some restrictions apply.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
